{"article_ids": ["7dcc9758baf5cb29"], "canonical_title": "How Worldwide Express automated freight exceptions with Amazon Bedrock", "category": "model_release", "confidence": 0.95, "description": "Worldwide Express built a multi‑agent solution on Amazon Bedrock to automate its less‑than‑truckload freight billing‑exception process. Six months after launch the system reduced active exceptions by 75%, shortened the time‑to‑cash by four weeks, and generated about $10 million in free cash flow.", "entities": ["org:amazon"], "first_seen": "2026-10-30T17:32:20Z", "id": "evt_7dcc9758baf5cb29", "importance_score": 4.39, "last_updated": "2026-10-30T17:32:20Z", "source_ids": ["aws-machine-learning"]}
